**4. How to Improve This Project to Industry Level:**
*   Implement **Refresh Tokens**. JWTs should expire fast (e.g., 15 mins). A refresh token (stored securely) is used to get a new JWT without forcing the user to log in again.
*   Implement **Password Reset** via email functionality.
*   Use a modern frontend framework (React or Next.js). While Vanilla JS is great for learning, industry standard for complex apps is React/Angular/Vue.
*   Set up centralized logging (Logback/SLF4J) and perhaps an ELK stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana) to monitor application health.
